# Google Identity Services ("Continue with Google"). Create an OAuth 2.0 Web
# application Client ID at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# (Authorized JavaScript origins: your dev/prod URLs, e.g. http://localhost:3000).
# Only the client ID is needed — no client secret on the frontend.
# The "Continue with Google" button stays hidden until this is set.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
